    "description": "Rock and Mineral Decor Lot - Assorted Pieces\nDiverse Geological Collection, Various Specimens\nVintage Collection\nThis expansive geological lot represents a diverse collection of natural minerals, fossils, and prehistoric artifacts. Featuring over 10 pounds of material, the collection is anchored by several large petrified wood slabs that showcase intricate fossilized wood grain. This set is ideal for display, educational purposes, or as a foundational collection for a budding lapidary enthusiast.\nItems Included:\nPetrified Wood: Multiple slabs and chunks with varied coloration and grain patterns\nMineral Clusters: Including amethyst druze, pyrite, and titanium-treated aura quartz points\nArrowheads: Two stone projectile points in a protective bag\nPolished Specimens: Various tumbled stones and a polished stone sphere\nDisplay Containers: One larger glass jar and three small metal-capped vials containing mineral sand and fragments\nCondition:\nMost specimens are in their natural raw or semi-polished states with characteristic inclusions and textures. The petrified wood slabs are stable with minimal modern chipping. Aura quartz points show bright iridescent finishes. Arrowheads remain intact without modern fracture. The larger glass jar shows a vintage label. Collection is sold as a bulk lot.\nWarehouse Location: Cleveland\nDue to our lighting, white glare lines may appear on items - This is NOT damage\nIf you have any questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item or general questions regarding and item, please click Contact Seller on the item page and send us a message. We are available to answer your questions Monday through Friday, 8 am - 3:00 pm, EST.\n* For combined shipping policy see the shipping tab.\nSome items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nSee Photos. Items sold as-is.",
